=== README.md ===
# Shop

A small storefront built with Next.js. Browse products, manage a cart and pay with Stripe.

## Getting started

Run `npm run dev` and open http://localhost:3000.
=== AGENTS.md ===
# Agent guide

## Commands

- Unit tests: `npm test`
- Lint: `npm run lint`

## Conventions

Components live in `components/` and use PascalCase file names. Business logic lives in `lib/`, never inside components.
=== docs/payments.md ===
# Payments

Payments use Stripe Checkout. Configure `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` and `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` in your environment.
Order totals are computed server side by the cart module before a session is created.
